  "body": "The presence of certain characters (\\r\\n\\t) is not specified for some of the setters. It's a similar case for \\0.\nAs noted in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1190027#c0 the handling of these characters by UAs varies greatly.\nClarifying the handling of these characters in a consistent way would be preferable. \n",
